OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA partly cloudy day with
OL,6,Fisolated showers possible through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Cloud breaks developing
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon, with some sunny
OL,9,Fintervals. Feeling cool in fresh
OL,10,Feasterly winds, particularly around
OL,11,Fthe coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells and
OL,14,Fpatchy cloud across northern counties.
OL,15,FCloudy with isolated showers across
OL,16,Fthe south. Brisk easterly winds
OL,17,Fcontinuing, especially for coastal
OL,18,Fparts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
