OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSome early morning sunny
OL,6,Fspells possible, then becoming largely
OL,7,Fcloudy through the day, but remaining
OL,8,Fdry. A fresh breeze, easing through
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Temperatures near
OL,10,Fnormal.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,14,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,15,Frain or showers, and a gentle breeze.
OL,16,FAny morning fog may be slow to clear.
OL,17,FTemperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
